data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `batch-video-ingestion` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nvideos = {\"videos\":[{\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"file_path\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"source_type\":\"local_file\",\"capture_seconds\":2,\"metadata\":{\"filename\":\"Trafic.mp4\",\"location\":{\"city\":\"宁波市\",\"district\":\"奉化区\"}}}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(videos, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --refresh --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"48ff292b-a769-4918-980e-e30777d9958c"},{"content":"我将严格执行测试流程。首先读取 skill 文件，然后执行 bash 命令，最后读取结果。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":125,"prompt_tokens":9632,"total_tokens":9757,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":42,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":125},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9632}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-d74f2f51-462e-9d15-b29f-b5c00c13a069","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8400-0d02-7a81-8c18-01b9838e4b7d-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 batch-video-ingestion skill 文件","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_71b48b215726403ebbb16563","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9632,"output_tokens":125,"total_tokens":9757,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":42}}},{"content":"---\nname: batch-video-ingestion\ndescription: Batch ingest local monitoring videos into the Elasticsearch video library with metadata, sampled-frame object summaries, and searchable documents. Use when Codex has a video directory, video manifest, camera_id, or multiple video files to index for later retrieval and statistics.\n---\n\n# Batch Video Ingestion\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides a directory, pass it as `--video-dir`. If the user provides a manifest, pass it as `--manifest-json`. A manifest may be a list of video records or an object with `videos`. Each record may include `video_id`, `camera_id`, `file_path`, `video_path`, `path`, `virtual_path`, `source_type`, `started_at`, `capture_seconds`, `metadata`, `location`, `description`, `tags`, `analysis_mode`, and optional `vector`.\n\n## Ingestion Modes\n\nAlways tell the user there are two ingestion modes and mention the time tradeoff:\n\n- Fast metadata-only ingestion: use `--analysis-mode metadata_only` or `--skip-content-detection`. This validates/probes the video, enriches metadata, and writes searchable fields to Elasticsearch. It does not sample frames or run YOLO. Use this for large batches, quick cataloging, or when the user only needs search by known metadata such as city, road, camera, filename, tags, description, and path.\n- Content-detection ingestion: use `--analysis-mode object_detection` (default). This probes the video, samples frames, runs YOLO object detection, tracks objects, and writes labels/counts/tracks to Elasticsearch. Warn that it is slower because model loading, frame extraction, and per-frame inference can take tens of seconds per video depending on sampling settings.\n\nWhen metadata is available, include as much relevant information as possible in the manifest: `location.city`, `location.district`, address, road, camera name, scene, tags, description, shooting time, owner scope, and any business labels. The script writes these into `metadata`, `location`, `search_terms`, `path_tokens`, and `content_text` so later retrieval can match them.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json <videos.json> --index citybrain-video-library --analysis-mode object_detection --config <config.json> --refresh --output <result.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--input`, `--manifest-json`, `--video-dir`, `--index`, `--analysis-mode`, `--skip-content-detection`, `--config`, `--output`, `--refresh`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Resolve video records from manifest, input JSON, or directory scan.\n2. Ensure the Elasticsearch index and mapping exist.\n3. Normalize each local video with `video-stream-ingestion`.\n4. Enrich the document with filename/path tokens, metadata, location, tags, description, and search terms.\n5. In `object_detection` mode, sample frames, run object detection, and run object tracking when available.\n6. Build a searchable video document and upsert it into Elasticsearch.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. It calls neighboring skill scripts by path and does not import shared registry modules.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `ingested_count`, `failed_count`, `index`, `documents`, and `failures`. Each document summary includes `ingestion_mode` and `content_detection_enabled`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_INPUT`\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n- Per-video failures are returned in `failures` while successful videos continue.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not run LLM event analysis during default ingestion. YOLO output is used only for object labels, counts, tracks, and retrieval metadata. This skill does not perform OCR yet; visible text extraction should be handled by a future OCR skill and added to `metadata` or `content_text`.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"d2ac52f3-a9a5-42b9-8972-6eda9ad8761e","tool_call_id":"call_71b48b215726403ebbb16563","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行 bash 命令进行测试：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":289,"prompt_tokens":10595,"total_tokens":10884,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":289},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10595}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-57c995ec-e7e9-97f3-98f6-3ba51d73be28","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8400-2a06-7ce1-92ac-a85a466955c1-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 batch-video-ingestion skill 的完整测试链路","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nvideos = {\"videos\":[{\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"file_path\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"source_type\":\"local_file\",\"capture_seconds\":2,\"metadata\":{\"filename\":\"Trafic.mp4\",\"location\":{\"city\":\"宁波市\",\"district\":\"奉化区\"}}}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(videos, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --refresh --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json"},"id":"call_e195b5ba5b334cea8e3ffe47","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10595,"output_tokens":289,"total_tokens":10884,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":0}}},{"content":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion\n\n\n\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nvideos = {\"videos\":[{\"video_id\":\"video-traffic-agent-test\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"file_path\":\"/mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4\",\"source_type\":\"local_file\",\"capture_seconds\":2,\"metadata\":{\"filename\":\"Trafic.mp4\",\"location\":{\"city\":\"宁波市\",\"district\":\"奉化区\"}}}]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(videos, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\n\n\npython /mnt/skills/custom/batch-video-ingestion/scripts/run.py --manifest-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/batch-video-ingestion/videos.json --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --refresh --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/batch-video-ingestion/result.json","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"29ff505e-1549-49ce-8f00-183d58a57420","tool_call_id":"call_e195b5ba5b334cea8e3ffe47","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"bash 命令执行完成。现在读取生成的结果文件：\n\n","additional_kwarg